        "text": "Solana is the best place public chain to bring the next era of Internet capital markets. It's engineered for mass adoption. Developers love building on it. The network processes massive amounts of data at high speed with extremely low costs, offering unmatched performance, low fees and our thriving developer ecosystem. Solana has proven security, scalability and a robust ecosystem. These features, when combined with R3's leading commissioned infrastructure, offer the strongest value proposition for institutions seeking to deploy tokenized real world assets or digital currencies on public networks. Of any layer one platform, Solana is the most used blockchain, not only by successful monthly transactions, but also in terms of real economic value. We are unlocking new value, new distribution channels and new liquidity. Together we're building the future of digital assets and market infrastructure. Be the first to build with R3 on Solana.",
